            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. Parent means a biological, foster, or adoptive parent, a stepparent, a legal guardian or an individual who stood in loco parentis to the employee when the employee was a child. \"Parent\" does not include the employee's grandparents or mother-in-law or father-in-law unless they stood in loco parentis.",
